 and a half years of work and an investment of about $10 million, Kung Fu Panda World was launched and made available to the public on April 12, 2010.\n\nAt present time, the game has been discontinued and removed, though no reason was ever specified.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kung-fu-panda-world--1", "videos": [{"id": 157217, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "it0VGbBAGIA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=it0VGbBAGIA", "title": "(PC) Kung Fu Panda World - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/it0VGbBAGIA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 157218, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MnQHITdreSg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MnQHITdreSg", "title": "Kung Fu Panda World", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MnQHITdreSg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 157219, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "7SOeK7xqhF4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7SOeK7xqhF4", "title": "Kung Fu Panda World Character Creation & Tutorial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7SOeK7xqhF4/hqdefault.jpg"}]}